            "quote": {
              "text": "I'm trying to plan out my week and was wondering if you could suggest some productivity apps that can help me stay organized."
            },
            "said_on": "2023-02-11",
            "sequence": 1,
            "source_id": "80856-1791154720819138000-30"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "pending",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I'm leaning towards Todoist since I already use it for task management, but I want to make sure it can fit into my daily routine. Can you suggest the best way to set reminders for my gym sessions, which I usually go to at 7:00 pm on Mondays, Wednesdays, and Fridays?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-02-11",
            "sequence": 3,
            "source_id": "80856-1791154789268733000-79"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "pending",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "What are some good ways to organize my tasks in Todoist? I have a lot of projects going on at the same time, and I want to make sure I'm prioritizing the right tasks."
            },
            "said_on": "2023-02-11",
            "sequence": 4,
            "source_id": "80856-1791154998391599000-137"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "no_candidates_unreviewed",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "How about exploring Todoist's features for tracking progress and achieving goals? For instance, can you tell me more about how to set and track goals in Todoist?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-02-11",
            "sequence": 5,
            "source_id": "80856-1791155066236994000-153"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "no_candidates_unreviewed",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I'm trying to plan out my week and was wondering if you could help me figure out the best time to schedule a meeting with a potential client."
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-30",
            "sequence": 6,
            "source_id": "80856-1791155074749963000-161"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "pending",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I'm pretty flexible, but I do have a few commitments already. I usually go to the gym on Mondays, Wednesdays, and Fridays, so I'd prefer to avoid scheduling the meeting during those times. How about we focus on Tuesday or Thursday?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-30",
            "sequence": 7,
            "source_id": "80856-1791155083550371000-165"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "failed",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I think Tuesday afternoon at 2:00 pm could work well. I need to make sure I'm done with the meeting before I head to the gym, which is usually at 6:00 pm."
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-30",
            "sequence": 8,
            "source_id": "80856-1791155413331265000-264"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "no_candidates_unreviewed",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I need to send some files to the potential client before the meeting. Can you help me figure out the best way to share them?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-30",
            "sequence": 9,
            "source_id": "80856-1791155742367163000-351"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "no_candidates_unreviewed",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I'll use Google Drive to share the files with the potential client. I'll create a folder with the necessary files and share the link with them via email."
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-30",
            "sequence": 10,
            "source_id": "80856-1791155759270892000-368"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "no_candidates_unreviewed",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
